    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1109">

                <pb facs="0804" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/5139.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Bevan to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 31, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On account closing down oil companies there are about hundred destitute Americans
                    all having returned since April. Request financial assistance. Have been refused
                    by this office. Suggest that notice <pb facs="0805" n="689" xml:id="pg689"/> be
                    given through press advising Americans not to come to Tampico for work.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bevan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
